{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08436","headline":"赠别王山人归布山 · 李白","name":"赠别王山人归布山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"王子析道论，微言破秋毫。\n还归布山隐，兴入天云高。\n尔去安可迟，瑶草恐衰歇。\n我心亦怀归，屡梦松上月。\n傲然遂独往，长啸开岩扉。\n林壑久已芜，石道生蔷薇。\n愿言弄笙鹤，岁晚来相依。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08436.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08436","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}